                                "sense_id": "c704839c-c648-3c11-911b-12fce623bea3",
                                "text": "[…] Mr. Cuming brought a declarator of common property in, and division of, the muirs in question. Pleaded for the Pursuer.—The pursuer's special infestment in the muirs as parts of the barony of Coxtoun excluded the defender, […]"
                            },
